{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:09 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:09 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:09 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"葵涌小巴站頭男司機車上暈倒 送院搶救\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d62ba6996c8c51f664e9c06d8db1d86/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_34_0.jpeg\"/><p>葵涌石蔭路北葵涌街市對開，今日（11月14日）傍晚近6時，一名小巴男司機停泊在站頭，準備上客前往青衣。然而乘客上車時，赫然發現男司機不省人事，隨即報案求助。救護員接報趕至，將司機送往仁濟醫院救治，目前其暈倒原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"小巴停泊站頭期間，男司機於車上暈倒。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5db997ac3b414d4af3a44b9142ac607a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴停泊站頭期間，男司機於車上暈倒。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd6ccab93b3be024685914b9c06784fc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_35_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴原定前往青衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fccf30964bdcfe50ca93c94ba1e7c43/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_34_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場位於葵涌石蔭路北葵涌街市對開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba6e91955c285b851393790a779c6be3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d738b924ce25fab8c5bed79562c538db/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_18_56_33.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.594494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:09:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:58:05.316430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:37.924918+00:00","content_hash":"cc755971b8f93db0069765f72ee0832d4c83a28daf8bc2fb6ea54d7a72977df3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}